  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Yi5OeKSYhEs?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/163435373-3249eef2-5258-48dc-aea7-4a3e18daab72.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在玩家登入、切換維度或重生傳送時提供保護，防止任何傷害，直到載入畫面結束。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cupboard\" rel=\"nofollow\">較新版本需要安裝 <strong>Cupboard</strong> 依賴項</a></span></p><p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/162617552-80038ed3-026b-42e1-8133-c00f6f9ad45e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">設定保護時間長度</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">設定是否忽略跌落傷害</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模組僅需安裝在伺服器端。若使用單人遊戲內建伺服器，亦可安裝在用戶端。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/162635503-85e3e64b-3263-4498-944e-ba9741a3c88d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></p><p>如果您喜歡這個模組，請考慮支持開發，任何支持都將不勝感激。</p><p>開發是無償的業餘活動，任何支持都能幫助投入更多時間。<br>您可以透過 Patreon 贊助我，或向他人推薦此模組。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/someaddons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/162637017-9a30d47b-493d-4743-9029-ac09dcc438f9.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"29\"></a></p>",
